# Executive offsites live on their own Netlify site and are served here under /offsite/.
# Do not add a rule redirecting /offsite to /offsite/: Netlify treats both as the same
# path, so such a rule redirects to itself and causes ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS.
# The offsite site adds the missing trailing slash itself with a small script.
/offsite/*  https://offsite.kuma.partners/:splat    200!
